    - lineId: route_reopened-brief-01
      textKey: narrative.route_reopened.brief.01
      englishFallback: 'The relief network is still moving: clinic supplies on the
        south lane, Fuel for water pumps on the north. The Ash Line logistics hub
        controls both stolen routes, but the city cannot wait for the fighting to
        end.'
      speaker: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b246bf6bcd56f4fcc82eaa559d71cd66, type: 3}
