    - lineId: route_reopened-brief-02
      textKey: narrative.route_reopened.brief.02
      englishFallback: Split the force. Keep both lifelines open, put the road crew
        on the disrupted lane, and take the assault squad through the hub gate. This
        is a controlled capture, not a demolition.
